category: Libs
build-depends: cygport bash-completion-devel gobject-introspection help2man libgirepository1.0-devel libglib2.0-devel
sdesc: "Glib-based library for talking to WWAN modems and devices (utilities)"
ldesc: "libmbim is a glib-based library for talking to WWAN modems and devices which
speak the Mobile Interface Broadband Model (MBIM) protocol."
